  "question": {
    "text": "Two persons start from the junction of two perpendicular roads with velocities <math><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mrow></math> and <math><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo></math> The rate at which the two persons separate is"
